OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,6,     FKate Molleson explores Mozart's
OL,7,     Frelationship with his sister
OL,8,     FNannerl, from their close bond in
OL,9,     Fchildhood to estrangement by the
OL,10,     Fend of their lives.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FFolk band Pons Aelius play live.
OL,13,     FTom Fetherstonhaugh on conducting
OL,14,     Fthe Fantasia Orchestra at his
OL,15,     Fforthcoming BBC Prom.
OL,16,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,17,     FLive at the BBC Proms: BBC
OL,18,     FNational Orchestra of Wales,
OL,19,     Fconductor Elena Schwarz and Alina
OL,20,     FIbragimova perform Mendelssohn's
OL,21,     FViolin Concerto in E minor.
