OL,5,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,7,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,8,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,9,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,10,     Feverything in between.
OL,11,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,12,     FLondon-based vocalist and
OL,13,     Fviolinist Alice Zawadzki, sitting
OL,14,     Fin for Soweto Kinch, spotlights
OL,15,     Fsome of the new jazz releases and
OL,16,     Fclassics that she appreciates.
OL,17,G0030 Through the Night
OL,18,     FViolinist Maria Duenas, plays
OL,19,     FBruch's Violin Concerto No 1. Alan
OL,20,     FGilbert leads the NDR
OL,21,     FElbphilharmonie in Brahms's first
OL,22,     Fsymphony in this concert.
